cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SKAL Bench: Routine and Special Core Analysis"
message: "If you use this software in published work, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kholosy
    given-names: Sohaib
    affiliation: "Kuwait Institute for Scientific Research (KISR), Petroleum Research Center"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-01
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A browser-based console for routine and special core analysis. It covers gas and liquid
  permeability with Klinkenberg correction, pulse decay, porosity and grain density by
  gravimetric and helium methods, mercury injection capillary pressure, centrifuge capillary
  pressure, relative permeability by steady-state, JBN and Brooks-Corey methods, wettability by
  Amott, USBM and contact angle, electrical properties including Archie parameters and the
  Waxman-Smits shaly-sand correction, low-field NMR petrophysics, stress dependence of
  permeability, rock typing, and measurement uncertainty. Every module states the equation it
  evaluates and the published source it follows.
keywords:
  - special core analysis
  - SCAL
  - routine core analysis
  - petrophysics
  - relative permeability
  - capillary pressure
  - wettability
  - Archie parameters
  - NMR petrophysics
  - reservoir engineering
